            "review_title": "Review at Bach Cigar Lounge",
            "review_text": "Becc P\n2 contributions\n0\nDefinitely worth your time for a visit!\nMar 2026 • Couples\nWe went to this Cigar Lounge and was greeted by Zu. She was very friendly, very polite and made sure we had what we needed for the best experience here. \nThe lounge is very up to date, nice selection and beautiful atmosphere to sit and chill after a long day. \nThe location is nice outside area is very inviting. The cigars were also very well priced and kept fresh and stored correctly in the humidors. \nAbsolutely worth a visit. 10/10\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
