            "review_title": "Review at Bach Cigar Lounge",
            "review_text": "dwm009\n3 contributions\n0\nPerfect cigar evening\nJun 2024 • Solo\nGreat experience from start to finish. I came for a quiet after dinner cigar while my kids were in bed. I went for a Romeo y Julieta Reserva Toro which was perfectly humidified, and paired it with a few Makers Marks and the bartenders own Old Fashioned. In all it was a lovely relaxed evening, with a little chat from the staff, but nothing overbearing. I’ll definitely be back whilst in Da Nang.\nRead more\nWritten June 11, 2024",
